OL,3,GNEWSAMeeting called to discuss future
OL,4,Aof fire-hit mill
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservative said: "Bradford
OL,7,FCouncil as the local authority must
OL,8,Ftake urgent action to properly secure
OL,9,Fthis site and robustly do so so that we
OL,10,Fare mitigating any future possibility
OL,11,Fof a major fire." The council has been
OL,12,Fapproached for comment.
